  "id": "sound-symbolism",
  "term": "sound symbolism",
  "definition": "Sound symbolism is the study of non-arbitrary links between speech sounds and meaning. It refers to systematic sound–meaning associations found in human languages, challenging the idea that these relationships are always arbitrary.",
